# Handoff/log files that every agent appends to. Union-merge so concurrent appends
# from parallel branches combine instead of conflicting — this is the recurring
# STATUS.md merge-conflict trap called out in AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md. The `union` driver
# is built into git (no config needed) and is honored by GitHub's server-side merge.
STATUS.md merge=union
PLAN.md merge=union
